meta {
  name: List Branch OPD Test Options
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-opd-tests/options?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~search: Vitamin
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  OPD equivalent of the lab **List Branch Lab Test Options** endpoint (GET /branch-opd-tests/options).
  
  Lightweight `{ id, name, price, sampleType, isFasting }` options for the
  Create-Order lab-test picker. Returns the active branch's **active default-variant**
  lab tests only (one orderable row per variant group), so a selected id is directly
  usable as an order item's `branchOPDTestId`; `price` is the list price (`priceMsrp`,
  minor units) and `sampleType`/`isFasting` (from the first sample in `configSnapshot`)
  populate the Diagnostic Items table. Scoped to the JWT tenant + active branch (no
  `branchId` in the query). `search` matches testName (case-insensitive). Omit
  `page` for the full array; supply `page` for a `{ data, total, page, limit }` envelope.
}
